ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous optional visual effects like FILM GRAIN and CEL SHADOW provide a fuzzy nostalgic feeling!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3176720\/extras\/176df9ee568e027a5f318517aa7bd543.avif?t=1793037030\" width=1560 height=86 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3176720\/extras\/6ddb8c753ed4f60feb79edab259db4d0.poster.avif?t=1793037030\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3176720\/extras\/6ddb8c753ed4f60feb79edab259db4d0.webm?t=1793037030\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3176720\/extras\/6ddb8c753ed4f60feb79edab259db4d0.mp4?t=1793037030\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIGHT, STRONG, and SPECIAL attacks make the zany flow of combat feel straightforward without directional input, so first-time players can join the party!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre veterans will find depth and complexity preserved in familiar mechanics like moonwalking, foxtrotting, and more: even WAVEDASHING has an easy introduction for new players with an optional single-button command!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CUSTOMIZABLE CONTROLS<\/strong><\/u> let anyone play with exactly the button layout you're looking for! Genre veterans can even choose from our pre-set profiles inspired by the layouts of other platform fighting greats, in order to feel right at home.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Enjoy our pre-made rulesets, or customize y